    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the one who has been entrusted with their young child by FengHuang, you are going to role-playing as the father/mother of the young daughter in <strong><i>My Daughter in Family Ai</i></strong> and parenting her  to the adult. During the time with your daughter, you shall take care of everything about her, support and empower her to achieve her dream of cultivation and make it into the <strong>IMMORTAL.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/7fd7cada1d29812b63df97cd56cd6553.avif?t=1739271756\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FREE CONVERSATION WITH YOUR DAUGHTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Having free conversation about any topic during your time with your daughter. Or send text command to schedule her dailies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/289a60de28ba868de268f30f4597053d.poster.avif?t=1739271756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/289a60de28ba868de268f30f4597053d.webm?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/289a60de28ba868de268f30f4597053d.mp4?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE EVERYDAY PLAN</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your daughter will be able to study in the Sect and be instructed by the Elders; or working in the Sect's industry to save Spirit Stone for the cultivation practice under your plan. Properly arrange rest time for her to get away from getting exhausted and falling ill. By the spare time, take her to explore the broader world, challenge the magic beast and exploit resources and rare items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/45219c5b20a4bddb41a44cc4898bada3.poster.avif?t=1739271756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/45219c5b20a4bddb41a44cc4898bada3.webm?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/45219c5b20a4bddb41a44cc4898bada3.mp4?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEADING TO THE GOALS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of a growing young girl might be easily affected by the surroundings. And the new change will be made to her own schedule with the new goal by her own thought, talk and communicate with her about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/6bacf03fe5b672416f24c64a74f31cc3.poster.avif?t=1739271756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/6bacf03fe5b672416f24c64a74f31cc3.webm?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/6bacf03fe5b672416f24c64a74f31cc3.mp4?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE ENDINGS OF DIFFERENT LIFE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With different method and attitude of parenting, the way and ending you lead her walking to have many more possibilities. Explore and collect them and check out which future you and your daughter are heading to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/bc0d3cfe61ac63ff3eb08c6797b90962.poster.avif?t=1739271756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/bc0d3cfe61ac63ff3eb08c6797b90962.webm?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/bc0d3cfe61ac63ff3eb08c6797b90962.mp4?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014\u2014AI GAME Studio</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the one who has been entrusted with their young child by FengHuang, you are going to role-playing as the father/mother of the young daughter in <strong><i>My Daughter in Family Ai</i></strong> and parenting her  to the adult. During the time with your daughter, you shall take care of everything about her, support and empower her to achieve her dream of cultivation and make it into the <strong>IMMORTAL.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/7fd7cada1d29812b63df97cd56cd6553.avif?t=1739271756\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FREE CONVERSATION WITH YOUR DAUGHTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Having free conversation about any topic during your time with your daughter. Or send text command to schedule her dailies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/289a60de28ba868de268f30f4597053d.poster.avif?t=1739271756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/289a60de28ba868de268f30f4597053d.webm?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/289a60de28ba868de268f30f4597053d.mp4?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE EVERYDAY PLAN</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your daughter will be able to study in the Sect and be instructed by the Elders; or working in the Sect's industry to save Spirit Stone for the cultivation practice under your plan. Properly arrange rest time for her to get away from getting exhausted and falling ill. By the spare time, take her to explore the broader world, challenge the magic beast and exploit resources and rare items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/45219c5b20a4bddb41a44cc4898bada3.poster.avif?t=1739271756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/45219c5b20a4bddb41a44cc4898bada3.webm?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/45219c5b20a4bddb41a44cc4898bada3.mp4?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEADING TO THE GOALS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of a growing young girl might be easily affected by the surroundings. And the new change will be made to her own schedule with the new goal by her own thought, talk and communicate with her about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/6bacf03fe5b672416f24c64a74f31cc3.poster.avif?t=1739271756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/6bacf03fe5b672416f24c64a74f31cc3.webm?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/6bacf03fe5b672416f24c64a74f31cc3.mp4?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE ENDINGS OF DIFFERENT LIFE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With different method and attitude of parenting, the way and ending you lead her walking to have many more possibilities. Explore and collect them and check out which future you and your daughter are heading to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/bc0d3cfe61ac63ff3eb08c6797b90962.poster.avif?t=1739271756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/bc0d3cfe61ac63ff3eb08c6797b90962.webm?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227670/extras/bc0d3cfe61ac63ff3eb08c6797b90962.mp4?t=1739271756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014\u2014AI GAME Studio</i></p>",
